  "corporate_events": [
    {
      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "type": "RUPS",
      "detail": "Waktu: 15:00:00 · Lokasi: Green Office Park 9, Auditorium, B Floor JI. Grand Boulevard BSD City BSD City, Tangerang15345 · Agenda #1: The meeting approved the 2025 annual report and financial statements audited by Mirawati Sensi Idris and granted full discharge to the Board of Directors and Commissioners.\nAgenda #2: The 2025 net income of Rp2.54 trillion was allocated to reserve funds (Rp2 billion) and retained earnings for working capital, with no cash dividend distributed.\nAgenda #3: The Board of Commissioners was authorized to set Director salaries for 2026, while Commissioner salaries were set to at least match 2025 levels.\nAgenda #4: The Board of Commissioners was authorized to appoint an OJK-registered independent auditor for the 2026 fiscal year.\nAgenda #5: The Board reported the utilization of 2025 Bond and Sukuk proceeds for BSD City infrastructure (Rp403.53 billion) and working capital (Rp118.37 billion).\nAgenda #6: The Board of Commissioners reported the appointment of Teddy Pawitra, Rudiantara, and Rizal E. Halim to the Audit Committee for a term ending in 2029.\nAgenda #7: Shareholders approved amendments to Articles 3, 48, and 66 of the Articles of Association regarding business activities and board membership composition.\nAgenda #8: The meeting approved the resignation of Muktar Widjaja and Michael Jackson Purwanto Widjaja and the appointment of Teky Mailoa as President Commissioner for a term ending in 2030.\nAgenda #9: The Board of Directors was authorized to formalize meeting resolutions in a notary deed and submit changes to the Company's Articles of Association to the Minister of Law.\nAgenda #10: The company submitted an official electronic report for which it holds full responsibility; further details are not stated."
    }
